{"fw_ld6_shelter_crim_1_0080","shelter",3,"reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|mood=calm",{1,"Once saw a cord running from a house to a generator",2,"So?",1,"I told myself that meant power, food, whiskey. Didn't actually know any of that",3,"Good reason to look before barging in, not a reason to expect a feast"}},
