{"fw_ld6_shelter_crim_1_0088","shelter",2,"reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|mood=angry",{1,"Those church people with their casseroles, all holier than thou, I hope they choke on a fuckin' noodle",2,"They've never done anything to you",1,"They looked at me funny, in the parking lot, in '85"}},
