{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0018","shelter",3,"reg=law,swat|mood=sad",{1,"Last I knew, my daughter was at her grandmother's in Elizabethtown",2,"That's close",1,"Used to be fifteen miles from home. Might as well be Mars when I don't know where she went",2,"You'd get there if you could",1,"I'd get there if I could, Lord",3,"I hope you get news. I won't pretend I can promise the trip"}},
